title: "Certified Branch Reductions for the Binary Covering Number K_2(11,3)"
type: software
abstract: "A reproducible certified reduction of the unresolved size-15 search for K_2(11,3). Exact structural constraints and a complete 150-case normalized partition leave 38 residual branches. Within four selected unresolved third-word children, checked RUP and DRAT certificates close 324 of 350 exhaustive fourth-word branches, leaving 26 and closing no complete child or normalized parent. The exact value remains open and the known interval 15 <= K_2(11,3) <= 16 is unchanged."
